Z||000000||grinthock||05-01-2001||01:57 AM||||OK Everyone... <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  (I make NOTHING from my www site ok!!)  <P>Here we go, I FINALLY as promised have produced the first <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  VIDEO!  BanditBALZ and I went out on Saturday and shot some footage, I took what I got, sat down tonight (took 3 hours) and cut and pasted up my video, got the music togeather and VOILA!<BR> <A HREF="http://grinthock.2y.net/georgefinal.mpg" TARGET=_blank>http://grinthock.2y.net/georgefinal.mpg</A> <P>File is 3.85 MEGS.. Small for Cable, just big enough to be annoying for dialup.<P>THERE is a direct link to the video, I am adding a video gallery to <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroworld.com</A>  but I have yet to get enough video's, we are shooting MORE AND MORE video, and the Michigan show, AND the drive to the michigan show, AND the race track, I plan on getting LOTS of video this summer for everyone... LET ME KNOW what you think of this video!!<P>ALSO, my www site has a 10 Simultanous user LIMIT so if it says busy, try again...  Last time I posted pics I got over 500 hits in 15 minutes....  If ANYONE has a T-1 or T-3 connection with a stable WWW server on it let me know, need to move my www site off this server....<P>HAVE FUN!||||reg||10
