Z||000006||grinthock||05-01-2001||10:09 AM||||Yeah I keep watching the video myself, can't get enough of it....    I am not using a real custom setup, I WANT A better capture card and I am looking into that today....  <P>here is my setup<P>Celeron 400<BR>512MB RAM ( &lt;-- the secret to video capture!)<BR>80 GIG Segate 15,000 RPM Ultra/160 SCSI Hard drive (another big item in video capture!)<BR>ATI All-In-Wonder PRO AGP (AGP is the key for capture)<P>Software wise?<P>Adobe Premiere 6.0<BR>Macromedia Director and Flash<BR>SoundForge<BR>XingMPEG Encoder<P><BR>Just spoke with Balz, he is getting the car ready for tonight, plan on getting some street racing shots, and some night video||||reg||1
